{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c4e4c9f5267b864d8e93d0ee3239fc4842928fb12f8b2117d3543b749383d37f", "ja": "（Fairy対PrincessのCD販売対決……。\n誰が一番売り上げを立てられるか、シビアな戦いだ）", "zh": "（Fairy对Princess的CD销售对决……。\n这是一场残酷的较量，看谁能创下最高销量。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "693659c8f5ea27a21bac073a91b575d18bcf7213b8c6355c43bb1b01a4e5cd92", "ja": "CDの手売り、新人アイドルの基本中の基本やんな♪\n今の私が、そこに付け加えられるとしたら……。", "zh": "亲手卖CD，这可是新人偶像基本中的基本呀♪\n要是现在的我，还能在那之上再添点什么的话……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1002_p", "source_sha256": "47ee0b3e26c92c305098b22b7140f82714b6271edd58e5b51c6730607282eacb", "ja": "お疲れ様、奈緒。\nさっきから独り言が多いけど、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，奈绪。\n你从刚才开始就一直自言自语，是怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "a00aa3e83fd9680d682e5eaced1bdaabcc84bd5d4afa22245cda0bd21074afd4", "ja": "も～{$P$}さん、\n独り言とちゃいますよ！", "zh": "真是的，{$P$}先生，\n我这不是在自言自语啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "dfa1e4010f9c8d238584549d3e58bb62b714b9c86a78081639fd791cf3d3243e", "ja": "今回の対決で、売り上げトップになる……\nそのための作戦を考えてたんです！", "zh": "我正在考虑在这次对决中成为销售第一……\n为此该采取什么策略！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a26c09d2e3f602cf0fde0295499f2c38b85d7b22a861c63613271d10380fef89", "ja": "作戦？", "zh": "作战？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "9e1e2ee1904d448a89c70a7f7746896f8f1fbc34432321afb9cf9c435f08d6af", "ja": "はい。相談したんですけど、やっぱ私の得意の喋りで\nお客さんに注目してもらうんがいいんちゃうかなって。", "zh": "是的。我也商量过了，还是觉得发挥我擅长的口才，吸引客人的注意比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "01617d51e926886f0d5ee1c83aed5e1911a3b3782da808e625967341dfbe8648", "ja": "ファンの人には、もちろん来てほしいですけど。\n私らを知らん人にも、聞いてもらいたいんです。", "zh": "粉丝们当然也希望能来。不过，我也想让那些不了解我们的人听听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "325f0f6c4eee688b983db7de244b2b5ec8c6398eae75ab23974a83165eefb78c", "ja": "「興味があるなら、足を止めるはず！\nまずはその人達に、アピールするんです！」って。", "zh": "“要是感兴趣的话，肯定会停下脚步的！\n首先要向那些人好好宣传！”这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "ef9b0783042c7bc976e54f99230281984e9ca42ea10aacc6e0a41f41a9c43ee2", "ja": "「ありさなら買います！　確実に！！」って。", "zh": "“还说‘是亚利沙的话肯定会买！绝对会买！！’”呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1010_p", "source_sha256": "88b829f2bf108c3580fc0ed3223ad1b573a4a0b29c066f81067d35490cbf622c", "ja": "なるほど、亜利沙に相談したのか……。\nファン目線での意見は、確かに重要だな。", "zh": "原来如此，你去找亚利沙商量了啊……\n从粉丝的角度提出的意见，确实很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "82b2f223d15b55edfc9e842fb624d0f74c5ca560fadeee08572c81316e700407", "ja": "そうなんです！　私は作戦とか自分では\n考えられへんから、亜利沙に色々聞いて……。", "zh": "就是这样！我自己想不出什么作战方案，所以就去问了亜利沙很多事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "df1678b268e7e9a9385bd4ef500c1b3110dcceb8788234d10c51bc2f1aacea03", "ja": "仲間でも……いや、仲間やからこそ！\n使えるもんは使わんと！", "zh": "即使是同伴……不，正因为是同伴才更要利用一切能利用的东西！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b68f040b9df3de35afc42d8b60a4ea5b0968c5d881ef6bbe010e97be5fa6e2c5", "ja": "そうだな。個人戦で勝つ事がグループにも影響するし、\n仲間の協力を得るのは間違ってないと思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。个人赛获胜也会影响整个小组，争取同伴的协助，我觉得没什么不对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "535fef1498f81b37f3934e5407ceb3dafde1559932754a896b11520a28c08ad1", "ja": "それに、瑞希は勝負師ですからね。\nいつ仕掛けてくるかわからへんし。", "zh": "而且，瑞希可是个赌徒呢。不知道她什么时候会出手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "a33f2a09a4cb3eeda230d76b8d30cac3a8edd3c660a2557709617295ac9bcd11", "ja": "だから、序盤で差をつけておきたいんです。\n厳しい戦いになるんは、目に見えてますからね。", "zh": "所以，我想在开局阶段先拉开差距。\n毕竟这会是一场艰苦的战斗，这是显而易见的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b27cd5ccda6183561714a2e661c7ea86f01bc64d86a13aabbb95b096fd7689e7", "ja": "なるほど。それが、奈緒の戦略ってことか。", "zh": "原来如此。这就是奈绪的策略啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "a139b5b2ab9433e0a3a6933719283b9e76db32b9e0673711747e9cc921961980", "ja": "えへへ、そういうことです！\nさぁ、ジャンジャン売って、勢いつけますよ～！", "zh": "嘿嘿，就是这么回事！\n来吧，大卖特卖，趁势冲起来吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1018_null", "source_sha256": "6b9d4e02937af468029baeabcb43ae38ef18d43f1a4db655c74e2bb6f0dea8a9", "ja": "CD販売イベント開始……", "zh": "CD发售活动开始……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "4443503cdf937f92e3024a4217f933f9110900a88713c2c2989fe33d17e695fd", "ja": "あっ、そこのツインテールのお姉さ～ん！\n1枚どう……ゲッ！　亜利沙！？", "zh": "啊，那个双马尾的大姐姐——！\n要不要来1张……咦！亚利沙！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1020_p", "source_sha256": "855000f6b9b3abf348b6a2812e082618f1016ad8e9229ecb4922638bf5efef71", "ja": "亜利沙……なんでここに……。\nいや、いいんだけど……。", "zh": "亚利沙……你怎么会在这里……\n不，倒也没什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0543_1021_p", "source_sha256": "6de69030c397adfa5b48b9c2c14dced30d8e981472a5905077696641a3014c1e", "ja": "（その後も、物陰からチラチラとツインテールが……。\n作戦が成功するかどうか、心配だったのかな……）", "zh": "（之后，双马尾还不时从掩体后面探出来……\n她是在担心作战能不能成功吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
